# Visual-harness output (scripts/ui-capture.py). LOCAL-ONLY by budget
# decision and regenerated from scratch on every run — the harness deletes
# the directory before shooting, so tracking these was 24 blobs rewritten
# and re-committed per visual pass (untracked 2026-10-29). The shots are
# eyeball material; the assertions that make them evidence live in
# check_thread_layout() and the per-surface DOM markers.
/ui-shots/
/ui-shots-fax-off/

